$ statuses --help
usage: statuses [--mesh value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

Optional switches:
  --mesh value
      default value m.grd
      Mesh file
  --help, -h
      Print this help message
  --markdown, -md
      Save this help message in a Markdown file
  --version, -v
      Print version
help, version or Markdown printed: cleaning up, then exit status 0
